  src/d3_data.cpp holds the DFT-D3 reference C6 coefficients and reference
  coordination numbers, covalent radii, <r^4>/<r^2> ratios, pairwise van der
  Waals radii and functional damping parameters, as tad-dftd3 and tad-mctc
  distribute them, converted to tables by tools/gen_d3_data.py (the C6 table
  and radii restored from float32 to the four-decimal values they were
  published with; no values are otherwise changed). The functional parameters
  are tad-dftd3's copy of s-dftd3's parameters.toml; each is a published fit,
  cited by DOI in src/d3_data.cpp.

  The D3 method and its reference data: S. Grimme, J. Antony, S. Ehrlich and
  H. Krieg, J. Chem. Phys. 132, 154104 (2010); rational damping: S. Grimme,
  S. Ehrlich and L. Goerigk, J. Comput. Chem. 32, 1456 (2011).
